{%- comment -%}
  Outfit and Inter, self-hosted. Both are SIL Open Font License.

  The prototype pulled them from Google Fonts with a render-blocking stylesheet
  on a third-party origin: an extra DNS lookup and TLS handshake before any text
  could paint, then eight static weight files. These are two variable fonts on
  the same origin as the page, so the whole weight range is one request each.

  Google's own latin and latin-ext subsets omit U+20B9, so without the third face
  every price on the page would render its rupee sign in a fallback font next to
  Inter digits. unicode-range keeps all of this lazy: only the subsets a page
  actually needs are fetched.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  crossorigin is not optional here. A font preloaded without it is fetched a
  second time by the CSS that uses it, so the preload costs bytes instead of
  saving time.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'purelane-inter-latin.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}
{{ 'purelane-outfit-latin.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}

<style>
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Inter';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 400 800;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url({{ 'purelane-inter-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'Inter';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 400 800;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url({{ 'purelane-inter-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'Inter';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 400 800;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url({{ 'purelane-inter-rupee.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+20B9;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'Outfit';
